WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.994
Welcome to Orbit. Learning and ambitions. Our focus is Verb patterns.

2
00:00:06.994 --> 00:00:16.797
Use the ing form after enjoy and mind. Use to plus a base verb after want, decide, hope, offer and manage.

3
00:00:16.797 --> 00:00:20.101
Zara enjoys drawing in her free time.

4
00:00:20.101 --> 00:00:23.615
She has decided to take an online course.

5
00:00:23.615 --> 00:00:26.224
Her friend offered to help her.

6
00:00:26.224 --> 00:00:35.622
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
